WEBVTT

00:00:09.850 --> 00:00:13.230
The astronomers are assembled in a large hall embellished with instruments.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:17.140
The president and members of the committee enter.

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.180
Everybody takes his seat.

00:00:21.330 --> 00:00:24.610
Entrance of six-man servants carrying the telescopes of the astronomers.

00:00:30.320 --> 00:00:40.600
President takes his chair and explains to the members his plan of a trip to the moon.

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:22.940
The scheme is approved by many, but one member violently opposes the same.

00:01:28.700 --> 00:01:29.820
After some arguments,

00:01:30.480 --> 00:01:32.920
The president throws his papers and books at his head.

00:02:00.000 --> 00:02:03.440
The trip proposed by the president is voted by acclamation.

00:02:03.880 --> 00:02:06.140
Five learned men make up their minds to go with them.

00:02:07.980 --> 00:02:09.620
The mine servants bring traveling suits.

00:02:34.160 --> 00:02:44.870
President Barbonfouille selects five colleagues to accompany him, Nostradamus, Alcofribas, Omega, Micromegas and Parapharagaramus.

00:02:45.960 --> 00:02:59.860
They enter the interior of our workshops where Smith, Mechanics, Weyers, Carpenters, Uppolsterers, etc. are working hard at the completion of the machine.

00:03:00.090 --> 00:03:18.540
Bromegas accidentally falls into a tub of nitric acid.

00:03:21.040 --> 00:03:24.760
A Walkman informs the astronomers that if they would ascend to the roof,

00:03:25.500 --> 00:03:29.160
they would witness a splendid spectacle, the casting of the gun.

00:03:30.090 --> 00:03:38.340
The astronomers ascension to a ladder and climb on the roof where they finally arrive.

00:03:39.520 --> 00:03:44.040
Against the horizon, the chimneys are seen belching forth volumes of smoke.

00:03:45.040 --> 00:03:46.940
Suddenly, a flag is hoisted.

00:03:48.140 --> 00:03:53.940
At the signal, a mass of molten steel is directed from each furnace into the mold for the gun.

00:03:55.120 --> 00:03:57.160
The mold performs flames and vapor.

00:03:58.920 --> 00:03:59.980
This causes much rejection.

00:04:00.000 --> 00:04:02.460
rejoicing among the enthusiastic astronomers.

00:04:03.980 --> 00:04:08.300
On the top of the roofs of the town, pompous preparations have been made.

00:04:08.980 --> 00:04:11.900
The shell is in position ready to receive the travelers.

00:04:15.100 --> 00:04:26.920
These arrive, respond to the acclamations of the crowd.

00:04:39.120 --> 00:04:40.160
and enter the shell.

00:05:00.120 --> 00:05:10.510
The wind closes the bridge through which they have passed.

00:05:13.690 --> 00:05:24.100
A number of gunners are now pushing the shell up and inclined into the mouth of the gunner.

00:05:30.000 --> 00:05:32.920
The cannon is loaded, the bridge is closed.

00:05:33.570 --> 00:05:38.000
Everyone is anxiously waiting for the signal, which starts the shell on its voyage.

00:05:40.110 --> 00:05:45.520
The officer gives the signal.

00:05:46.180 --> 00:05:50.080
The gun is fired, and the shell disappears into space.

00:05:57.120 --> 00:05:59.980
The shell coming closer every minute, the...

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:04.740
The moon magnifies rapidly until finally it attends colossal dimensions.

00:06:05.840 --> 00:06:08.750
Suddenly, the shell pierces the eye of the moon.

00:06:11.020 --> 00:06:12.700
The shell comes down with a crash.

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:27.850
The astronomers get out and are delighted at the landscape which is new to them.

00:06:40.880 --> 00:06:48.160
Against the horizon, the Earth is rising slowly into space, illuminating the picture with a fantastic light.

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:52.540
The astronomers inspecting the strange country see craters everywhere.

00:06:53.730 --> 00:06:59.410
Just as they are about to explore, an explosion throws the unfortunate man violently in all directions.

00:07:10.080 --> 00:07:13.900
The astronomers show signs of fatigue after the rough trip they have just had.

00:07:20.080 --> 00:07:23.020
They stretch themselves hard on the ground and go to sleep.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:28.480
Seven gigantic stars representing the great bear appear slowly.

00:07:30.000 --> 00:07:35.260
stars come faces of women who seem annoyed at the presence of these intruders in the moon.

00:07:36.220 --> 00:07:45.590
In their dreams they see passing in space comets, meteors, etc. Then the stars are replaced by a lovely

00:07:45.590 --> 00:07:53.020
vision of Phoebus on the crescent, of Saturn in his globe surrounded by a ring, and of charming

00:07:53.020 --> 00:07:59.440
young girls holding up a star. They decide to punish the terrestrial in an exemplary manner.

00:08:00.120 --> 00:08:06.640
by order of phoebus snow is falling from all quarters covering the ground with his white coat

00:08:06.640 --> 00:08:20.960
the cold becomes terrible the unfortunate voyagers wake up half frozen they decide without hesitation

00:08:20.960 --> 00:08:28.030
and in spite of the danger to descend into the interior of a great crater in which they disappear

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:29.980
one-by-one while to see

00:08:30.000 --> 00:08:43.590
no storm is still raging. The astronomers arrive in the interior of a most curious grotto filled

00:08:43.590 --> 00:08:55.340
with enormous mushrooms of every kind. One of them opens his umbrella to compare its size with a

00:08:55.340 --> 00:08:59.970
mushroom. But the umbrella suddenly takes root and transforming itself into...

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:06.540
a mushroom starts growing gradually attending gigantic proportions the astronomers suddenly

00:09:06.540 --> 00:09:12.040
notice strange beings coming out from underneath the mushrooms while making singular contortions

00:09:12.760 --> 00:09:20.310
these are the selenites or inhabitants of the moon a fantastical being rushes on an astronomer

00:09:20.310 --> 00:09:26.870
who defends himself and with a stroke of his umbrella the selenite bursts into a thousand pieces

00:09:30.000 --> 00:09:37.340
A second suffers the same fate, but the Selenites are arriving in Numbers.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:44.240
Terrified astronomers, to serve themselves, take flight with the Selenites in pursuit.

00:09:45.160 --> 00:09:52.090
Succombing to Numbers, the astronomers are captured, bound, and taken to the palace of the king of the Selenites.

00:09:52.660 --> 00:09:57.710
On a splendid throne, surrounded by living stars, the Selenite king is seated.

00:10:00.060 --> 00:10:03.840
President Barbonfouilly makes a dash for the king of the Selenites

00:10:04.180 --> 00:10:08.260
and, lifting him like a feather, throws him violently on the ground.

00:10:08.820 --> 00:10:10.920
The unfortunate king burst like a bombshell.

00:10:19.610 --> 00:10:22.370
Gastronomers run away in the midst of the general disorder.

00:10:23.080 --> 00:10:24.960
The Selenite army is pursuing them.

00:10:26.080 --> 00:10:29.980
Gastronomers run at full speed, turning around each time they are pressed to come.

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:33.200
and reducing the fragile beings to dust.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.070
The still increasing number of selenites

00:10:37.100 --> 00:10:40.520
obliges the astronomers to take desperately to flight again.

00:10:41.880 --> 00:10:44.800
At last, the astronomers have found their shell

00:10:44.800 --> 00:10:46.740
and quickly shut themselves in the interior,

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:50.730
thanks to the advance they have succeeded in getting over their adversaries.

00:10:51.200 --> 00:10:54.520
Only one, the president, has been left behind.

00:10:55.510 --> 00:10:58.310
He rushes to the rope which hangs from the point of the shell

00:10:58.310 --> 00:10:59.970
and letting himself sleep.

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:05.050
down the rope, it gives it an impetus which causes the shell to fall off the edge of the moon.

00:11:05.390 --> 00:11:10.760
A selenite clinging to the shell to hold it back is drawn with it and hanging on the projectile

00:11:10.760 --> 00:11:22.400
accompanies it in its drop. The shell falls with sickening rapidity. The sea appears.

00:11:24.410 --> 00:11:29.840
We continue following the course of the shell into the bottom of the ocean. The shell balances

00:11:30.660 --> 00:11:33.720
and, thanks to the hermetically sealed air in its interior,

00:11:34.940 --> 00:11:38.460
rises slowly to the surface to the puzzlement of the fishes.

00:11:39.660 --> 00:11:43.120
The shell is picked up by a steamer which tows it to port

00:11:43.120 --> 00:11:46.320
where a general ovation awaits the happy return.
